msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Yuri「*Gasp*...... It, it's Takasu-kun......」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Ah......! E-Es Takasu-kun......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Happy New Year, sensei.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Feliz Año Nuevo, sensei.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Ah...... This is the person I met before,＿Koigakubo-san......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ah...... Es la persona que conocí＿antes, Koigakubo-san......）」"

msgid "Yuri「......I understand. I know what you're＿thinking right now.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......Lo entiendo. Sé lo que＿estás pensando ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Come again?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo dice?」"

msgid "Yuri「You thought, \"Alone in a diner on New＿Year's? You're the poster child for＿single women,\" didn't you?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Pensaste: \"¿Sola en un restaurante＿en Año Nuevo? Eres el retrato perfecto＿de las solteras\", ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, not really......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, para nada......」"

msgid "Yuri「\"No one will want a wife that can barely＿even cook, you old maid!\" ......That's＿what you were thinking, right?」"
msgstr "Yuri「\"¡Nadie querrá una esposa que apenas＿sabe cocinar, solterona!\" ......Eso es＿lo que estabas pensando, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I was thinking nothing of the sort......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No pensaba nada de eso......」"

msgid "Yuri「Well, you're wrong. WRONG! Even I＿have some cooking ability!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Pues te equivocas. ¡TE EQUIVOCAS!＿¡Hasta yo sé cocinar un poco!」"

msgid "Yuri「But to bother cooking for one person＿is a big waste of money! It's wasteful to＿have a surplus of ingredients, right?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Pero cocinar para una sola persona es＿un gran gasto. Es un desperdicio que＿sobren ingredientes, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Er, um...... Right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm, ah...... Sí, claro.」"

msgid "Yuri「If I just had someone to eat with, I＿would gladly cook. But I don't. No one's＿waiting for me when I come home!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si tan solo tuviera con quién comer,＿cocinaría con gusto. Pero no. ¡Nadie＿me espera cuando llego a casa!」"

msgid "Yuri「The diner can take away my heartache.＿I'm welcomed with warm food and＿warm smiles from the employees!」"
msgstr "Yuri「El restaurante alivia mi dolor. ¡Aquí＿me reciben con comida caliente y las＿cálidas sonrisas de los empleados!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Good for you...... I'm gonna go now......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué bien por usted...... Ya me voy......」"

msgid "Yuri「......It's not good! Not good at ALL! Why＿am I alone even on New Year's?」"
msgstr "Yuri「......¡No está bien! ¡Para NADA＿bien! ¿Por qué estoy sola incluso＿en Año Nuevo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I don't have the answers...... It's a＿mystery......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, no tengo las respuestas......＿Es un misterio......」"

msgid "Yuri「You don't understand...... As if a high＿school boy could understand an old＿maid's loneliness!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Tú no lo entiendes...... ¡Como si un＿chico de preparatoria pudiera entender＿la soledad de una solterona!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Umm, I don't know about your＿loneliness, but I don't think it's weird to＿go to a diner by yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ehm, no sé sobre su soledad,＿pero no creo que sea raro ir sola＿a un restaurante.」"

msgid "Yuri「What......?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¿Qué......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not all that uncommon to see＿people coming here alone. I often see＿girls coming in by themselves......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es tan raro ver gente venir＿sola. A menudo veo a chicas entrando＿por su cuenta......」"

msgid "Yuri「Really? They don't seem lonely to you?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¿En serio? ¿No parecen sentirse solas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No one would think that. Humans don't＿actually care about other people all＿that much.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Nadie pensaría eso. A los humanos＿en realidad no les importan tanto＿las demás personas.」"

msgid "Yuri「Even on New Year's?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¿Incluso en Año Nuevo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yes. No one cares, be it on Christmas＿or Valentine's.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. A nadie le importa, ni en＿Navidad ni en San Valentín.」"

msgid "Yuri「......I see. You're right...... Maybe I was＿just being self-conscious......」"
msgstr "Yuri「......Ya veo. Tienes razón...... Tal＿vez solo me sentía cohibida......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you okay now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ya está bien?」"

msgid "Yuri「Yeah...... I'm sorry I got so distraught.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Sí...... Perdón por alterarme tanto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No worries. Please cheer up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No se preocupe. Por favor, anímese.」"

msgid "Yuri「Thank you...... Well, see you later,＿Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Gracias...... Bueno, nos vemos＿luego, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（*Sigh*...... She can be quite the＿handful......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（*Suspiro*...... Sí que puede＿ser difícil de tratar......）」"

msgid "Yuri「I was alone on Christmas, on New＿Year's Eve, and at Hatsumode! And I'll＿probably be alone on Valentine's and」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Estuve sola en Navidad, en Nochevieja＿y en el Hatsumode! ¡Y probablemente＿esté sola en San Valentín y」"

msgid "Yuri「White Day too! Why?」"
msgstr "Yuri「en White Day también! ¿Por qué?」"
